    <string name="level_explainer_daily_title">Daily streak</string>
    <string name="level_explainer_daily_body">One fresh board a day, on a %1$d×%1$d grid. Clear it and your streak goes up; miss a day and it starts again, unless you spend a freeze.</string>

    <string name="score_explainer_title">Score</string>
    <string name="score_explainer_body">Every dog you place is worth points, and a bigger board pays more per dog. Land them one after another without a wrong guess and a combo multiplier builds; land them quickly and a speed bonus stacks on top. Finishing pays a bonus of its own, worth more on a hard board and more again for every bone you still have.</string>
    <string name="score_explainer_paws">The paws at the end measure your score against par — what a clean, quick run on this board is worth. Three paws means you got close to it.</string>

